  m_Name: L1107_MovementSlowInconsistent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exerciseNumber: 07
  exerciseName: MovementSlowInconsistent
  exerciseTitle: Movement Slow Inconsistent
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458661
  exerciseText: Movement is too slow and inconsistent depending on framerate
  hintText: Log all the elements in the linearVelocity equation, is there someting
    that shouldn't be there?
  solutionText: The code is using Time.deltaTime in the calculation to set the linearVelocity,
    but when setting this you should not use deltaTime since it will be used in the
    background when the physics system actually moves the object.
